      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is hard to reach and i don't want to wait days for a call back just for a fever. the 3000mg thing is for normal people right? since i know my liver is a bit messed up, what's a dose that's actually going to work for the fever without being too much? can i just do 1000mg or maybe even 1500mg in one go to get it over with?",
